# Build context for the Coolify/Docker image.
#
# Everything here is either regenerated in the build, enormous, or a secret.
# Without it the context is ~1.5 GB, because the repo carries a 513 MB fp32
# checkpoint, a 540 MB merged LoRA and a PyTorch venv, none of which the
# running server touches.

.git
node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets, always.
.env
.env.*

# Model weights and training artefacts. The int8 SmolLM2 file the browser
# downloads is fetched during the image build; see the Dockerfile.
public/nano/smollm-fp32.bin
public/nano/smollm-int8.bin
public/models/
engines/nano/adapters/
engines/nano/data/
engines/nano/.build/
engines/nano/tools/.venv/

# Rust toolchain output. The compiled hnsw wasm is committed under public/.
crates/*/target/
crates/*/pkg/

# Local tooling that has no business in a runtime image.
.lighthouseci/
.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
